Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 16:35:28 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Build Gradle 4.0 with Gradle 3.0 (no docs, no tests)

Alternate build files in the Gradle 3.0 DSL (settings.gradle.3.0 and
*.gradle.3.0), the original build files are untouched. buildSrc/settings.gradle
selects buildSrc/build.gradle.3.0 only when the running Gradle is 3.0.
buildSrc/src/bootstrap-3.0 (compiled only by build.gradle.3.0): stubs of the
newer task annotations (Classpath, PathSensitive) and a java-library plugin
for 3.0 (api, implementation, runtimeOnly, runtimeClasspath configurations).
WriteProperties and PropertiesUtils are compiled into buildSrc from core.
Kotlin (gradle-script-kotlin 0.9.0, Kotlin 1.1.0) is included.

Run: -c settings.gradle.3.0 clean install -Pgradle_installPath=build/distributions/exploded

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
