From 163efa0d00c63c86412cdb4a098fe6a594b16346 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: noname713705 <noname713705@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 22:27:38 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Rebuild Gradle 4.0 from its original build files
 (download fixes only)

The bootstrapped 4.0 (built by Gradle 3.0) rebuilds REL_4.0 from the original
build files. Fixes, all marked "bootstrap:":
- Maven Central first (repo.gradle.org does not mirror it anymore)
- http-builder 0.7.2 (on no repository anymore) -> 0.7.1
- org.samba.jcifs:jcifs -> jcifs:jcifs (same version)
- docs fonts resolved leniently (gone from the Google Fonts urls)

Run: clean install -Pgradle_installPath=build/distributions/rebuilt

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 build.gradle                 | 2 ++
 buildSrc/build.gradle        | 5 ++++-
 gradle/dependencies.gradle   | 3 ++-
 subprojects/docs/docs.gradle | 5 ++++-
 4 files changed, 12 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

